{
  "version": "v3",
  "about": "Fixed questions for scripts/eval_chatbot.py. expect_cards: cards that must be retrieved. must_include: groups of phrases; each group is passed when ANY of its phrases appears in the answer (case-insensitive). refuse: the answer must say it does not have the information. follow_up_of: ask right after that question, in the same conversation. Expected facts come from the real v3 outputs; update them when the data changes.",
